---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { u } from '../lib/url';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Work with us."
  eyebrow="Career"
  description="Internships, residencies, and project-based collaborations with the New Afro team — across curation, cultural marketing, and creative direction."
>
  <p>
    We welcome students or recent graduates interested in creative industries
    management, cultural marketing, or creative direction and curatorial
    assistance. Roles are project-based and run alongside our exhibitions and
    pop-up programmes across Mainz, Cotonou, Abidjan, København, and Paris.
  </p>

  <h2>What we look for</h2>
  <p>
    Curiosity, care, and a working knowledge of at least one of the cultural
    contexts we operate in. Multilingualism — particularly French, German, or
    a West African language — is a strong plus.
  </p>

  <h2>Open positions</h2>
  <p>
    No specific roles are open right now. If you'd like to be in touch about
    future opportunities, send a short note about your practice via the
    contact page.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a class="na-btn" href={u('/contact-7')}>Contact us</a>
  </p>
</PageLayout>
